+#. ``credential_provider``
+
+    .. versionadded:: 5.6
+
+    Dotted path to a :class:`redis.CredentialProvider` subclass, which is
+    resolved and instantiated at connection setup time. When set, the
+    ``username`` and ``password`` fields are removed from the connection
+    parameters to avoid conflicts. An unresolvable path raises
+    :exc:`ImportError`, and a value that is not a ``CredentialProvider``
+    subclass raises :exc:`ValueError`.
+
+    Example::
+
+        result_backend = 'redis://host:port/db?credential_provider=redis.UsernamePasswordCredentialProvider'
+
